      "content": "<h2><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000950001\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Factors to Consider When Renting</b></span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc9al4hz68chmo\",\"id\":\"toc_odbdvxdjatwe\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_odbdvxdjatwe\"><b> </b><br></span></h2><h3 style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Budget and Affordability</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toctd97xade4czb\",\"id\":\"toc_2eprdey1erma\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_2eprdey1erma\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toctd97xade4czb\",\"id\":\"toc_2eprdey1erma\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_2eprdey1erma\"> </span></h3><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-margin-top=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Fix a budget first before searching. Hennur has a bandwidth of ₹10,000 to ₹50,000 a month depending on accommodation.</span></p><h3 style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Proximity to Workplace or College</span><span data