    {
      "content": "<h2><b><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000950001\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\">NoBroker</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" geo_transformation\":{\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false,\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false}},\"name\":\"_tocpx73th4j99mb\",\"id\":\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\">&nbsp;</span></b><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocpx73th4j99mb\",\"id\":\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\"><b>&nbsp;</b><br></span></h2><h3 style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b><br></b></span><p><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">A step-by-step process for searching for a rental flat in Bellandur using NoBroker</span></p></h3><ul><li><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocpx73th4j99mb\",\"id\":\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Please log in to <b>NoBroker</b> and search for \"<b>Hennur</b>.\"</span><br class=\"zw-br\"></span></li><li><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocpx73th4j99mb\",\"id\":\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Use the filters (budget, type of flat, etc.)</span><br class=\"zw-br\"></span></li><li><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocpx73th4j99mb\",\"id\":\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">See the listings along with the details.<br></span></span></li><li><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocpx73th4j99mb\",\"id\":\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Approve the owners for queries or site visits.</span><br class=\"zw-br\"></span></li><li><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocpx73th4j99mb\",\"id\":\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Visit, negotiate, and sanitize the rental contract.<br><br></span></span></li></ul><h3><p><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocpx73th4j99mb\",\"id\":\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_1k15gmtp3c8a\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><span data-doc-id=\"3105201000000950001\" style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"><b>Probability of Finding a flat with No Broker</b></span></span></span></p></h3>",
      "type": "text-block"
    },
    {
      "content": "<p></p><p data-header=\"3\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading3\" data-margin-bottom=\"14.04pt\" data-margin-top=\"14.04pt\" data-hd-info=\"3\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000950001\" style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"></p><h2><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>How to Improve Your Success Rate in Finding a Rental Flat in Bellandur</b></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Now that the listings are stale, and some owners never take them down, do the following to increase your chances:</span></p><p></p><ul><li style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Fresh Listings First<br></b></span>Use only new posts or those with minimal reviews.</li></ul><ul><li style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Call Instead of Messaging<br></b></span>Calling receives very prompt responses, and anyway, if a flat is occupied ask them for similar ones.</li></ul><ul><li style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Contact More Owners and Brokers<br></b></span>Call as many owners (at least 10) and on other platforms.</li></ul><ul><li style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Managed Properties<br></b></span>The listings would have been kept current by property managers, e.g. <b>KOTS</b>, thus ensuring correct availability.</li></ul><ul><li style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Visit in Person for Quicker Deals<br></b></span>Be prompt, and visit the properties in person.</li></ul><ul><li style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Negotiate Wisely<br></b></span>Make token advance and ask for more benefits like extra time for movability or rent discount.</li></ul><p data-header=\"3\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading3\" data-margin-bottom=\"14.04pt\" data-margin-top=\"14.04pt\" data-hd-info=\"3\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><br></span></p><h2 style=\"margin: 12pt 0px; line-height: 1.2; direction: ltr;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Things to Consider After Finalizing a Rental House </b></span></h2><p data-header=\"3\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading3\" data-margin-bottom=\"14.04pt\" data-margin-top=\"14.04pt\" data-hd-info=\"3\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin: 14.04pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Budget:</b> Your rent is proportional to your income.</span><br class=\"zw-br\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Legal: </b>Verify the title deeds, agreements, and contracts.</span><br class=\"zw-br\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Neighborhood:</b> Ensure it is safe, near work, and school, and is family-oriented.</span><br class=\"zw-br\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Size and Layout of the House:</b> Keep the room as well as affordability<br></span></span></p><p data-header=\"2\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading2\" data-margin-bottom=\"6pt\" data-margin-top=\"18pt\" data-hd-info=\"2\" data-line-height=\"1.6\" data-doc-id=\"3105201000000950001\" style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\" data-doc-type=\"writer\"></p><h2><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Common Challenges and How to Overcome Them</b></span></h2><b>High Demand</b><br><a href=\"https://www.kots.world/bangalore/flats-for-rent-in-hennur\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">Rental houses in Hennur</a> are in high demand. Start your search early to secure the best options.<br><b>Negotiating Rent</b><br>Don't hesitate to negotiate the rent. Landlords are often open to discussions.<br><b>Understanding Legal Agreements</b><br>Read the lease agreement carefully. Ensure all terms are clear and documented.<p></p><h2 style=\"margin: 14.94pt 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocdf1k57l3k664\",\"id\":\"toc_5xq5o3j67xmz\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"